Models (not included)
---------------------
No model weights are included or downloaded by the nodes. tools/download_model.py fetches, when you run it:
- Wan-AI/Wan2.1-T2V-1.3B (model card: Apache-2.0): base generator config and weights, umT5-XXL text encoder, VAE, tokenizer.
- ZihanSu/Self_Gradient_Forcing_Plus (model card: Apache-2.0): chunkwise/model.pt and, if requested, framewise/model.pt.
